      "Structure: Contrarian take + numbered reasons + question. Example: \"Ping pong tables and free snacks are not culture, they're a distraction from culture. Here's why: 1) They're easy to fund and require no hard decisions. 2) They say nothing about how disagreements get handled. 3) Real culture shows up in what happens when something goes wrong, not in the break room. What's a moment that actually revealed your company's culture?\"",
